 "site_rule": {
  "today": "Map the real day of the year onto the Charter year: day 1 is Eo 1st, each month is 36 days in order, and days 361 to 365 are the five Still Days (in a leap year, the last real day repeats the fifth Still Day). The year shown stays 175 EC, the setting's present.",
  "cycle_epoch": "Site convention: Eo 1st, 175 EC, is a Sunsdawn; the Cycle then runs on without restarting at months or years.",
  "show": "Today's date (for example: Graveday, Liora 18th, 175 EC), the season, the next three feasts, and a line for the next King Tide."
 }
}
